# Docker Volume

1) Create a new named volume
  docker volume create <VOLNAME>

2) List available volumes
  docker volume ls

3) Show details/inspect volume
  docker volume inspect <VOLNAME>

4) delete docker volume
  docker volume rm <VOLNAME>


# Docker Run command options with Docker volumes

1) -v [VOLNAME]:[container_directory]
2) -v [VOLNAME]:[container_directory]:ro/wo -> with specific permission

# Docker run command and bind mounting options

1) docker run -v /home/user/project:/cont-dir myimage
  
